ptions.md\",\n      \"note\": \"A place link with no coordinates (a short link can resolve to this): search the name, let the rider confirm\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ch%E1%BB%A3+B%E1%BA%BFn+Th%C3%A0nh/\"\n      },\n      \"expect\": {\n        \"kind\": \"query\",\n        \"q\": \"Chợ Bến Thành\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"q-text-ftid\",\n      \"label\": \"documented — not yet observed\",\n      \"source\": \"docs/how-it-works/routing-options.md\",\n      \"note\": \"Where a short place link often lands: ?q= holds a name and address, no coordinates. Search the text.\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"https://maps.google.com/?q=Ch%E1%BB%A3+B%E1%BA%BFn+Th%C3%A0nh,+L%C3%AA+L%E1%BB%A3i,+Qu%E1%BA%ADn+1&ftid=0x0:0x0\"\n      },\n      \"expect\": {\n        \"kind\": \"query\",\n        \"q\": \"Chợ Bến Thành, Lê Lợi, Quận 1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"directions-with-stop\",\n      \"label\": \"documented — not yet observed\",\n      \"source\": \"docs/how-it-works/routing-options.md\",\n      \"note\": \"Directions link: the first segment is the origin, the last is the destination, the ones between are stops. Coordinates are !1d<lng>!2d<lat> per waypoint, in order\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Landmark+81/Dinh+%C4%90%E1%BB%99c+L%E1%BA%ADp/Ch%E1%BB%A3+L%E1%BB%9Bn/@10.77,106.68,13z/data=!4m20!4m19!1m5!1m1!1s0x1:0x2!2m2!1d106.7219!2d10.7951!1m5!1m1!1s0x3:0x4!2m2!1d106.6953!2d10.7770!1m5!1m1!1s0x5:0x6!2m2!1d106.6505!2d10.7503!3e0\"\n      },\n      \"expect\": {\n        \"kind\": \"directions\",\n        \"destination\": {\n          \"lat\": 10.7503,\n          \"lng\": 106.6505,\n          \"name\": \"Chợ Lớn\"\n        },\n        \"stops\": [\n          {\n            \"lat\": 10.777,\n            \"lng\": 106.6953,\n            \"name\": \"Dinh Độc Lập\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"directions-destination-no-coords\",\n      \"label\": \"documented — not yet observed\",\n      \"source\": \"docs/how-it-works/routing-options.md\",\n      \"note\": \"Directions link whose destination has no coordinates in the data: search its text, never reuse the origin's coordinates\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Landmark+81/B%E1%BB%87nh+vi%E1%BB%87n+Ch%E1%BB%A3+R%E1%BA%ABy,+Qu%E1%BA%ADn+5/@10.77,106.68,13z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m5!1m1!1s0x1:0x2!2m2!1d106.7219!2d10.7951!1m0!3e9\"\n      },\n      \"expect\": {\n        \"kind\": \"directions\",\n        \"destination\": {\n          \"q\": \"Bệnh viện Chợ Rẫy, Quận 5\"\n        },\n        \"stops\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"directions-latlng-segment\",\n      \"label\": \"documented — not yet observed\",\n      \"source\": \"docs/how-it-works/routing-options.md\",\n      \"note\": \"Directions to a raw lat,lng segment, origin = the rider\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Your+location/10.7721095,106.6980277/@10.77,106.69,15z\"\n      },\n      \"expect\": {\n        \"kind\": \"directions\",\n        \"destination\": {\n          \"lat\": 10.7721095,\n          \"lng\": 106.6980277\n        },\n        \"stops\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"text-around-url\",\n      \"label\": \"documented — not yet observed\",\n      \"source\": \"docs/how-it-works/routing-options.md\",\n      \"note\": \"Extra words and a Plus Code before the URL: take the URL\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"QPG4+4Q https://maps.google.com/?q=10.5,106.5\"\n      },\n      \"expect\": {\n        \"kind\": \"coords\",\n        \"lat\": 10.5,\n        \"lng\": 106.5\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"out-of-range\",\n      \"label\": \"documented — not yet observed\",\n      \"source\": \"docs/how-it-works/routing-options.md\",\n      \"note\": \"Coordinates out of range: reject\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"text\": \"https